msgstr "Linux Bash (krever ``jq`` for å lese JSON)::"

#: ../doc/agent_cli.rst:256
msgid ""
"The environment variable selects a session for commands launched from this "
"terminal; it does not change a system-wide setting. Starting a session does "
"not set the variable automatically. After stopping the session, clear the "
"selection with ``Remove-Item Env:OPENSHOT_SESSION`` in PowerShell or ``unset"
" OPENSHOT_SESSION`` in Bash."
msgstr ""
"Miljøvariabelen velger en økt for kommandoer startet fra denne terminalen; "
"den endrer ikke en systemomfattende innstilling. Å starte en økt setter ikke"
" variabelen automatisk. Etter å ha stoppet økten, fjern valget med ``Remove-"
"Item Env:OPENSHOT_SESSION`` i PowerShell eller ``unset OPENSHOT_SESSION`` i "
"Bash."

